      "content": "\"finding a quiet place to rest\"... i don't even know if that's possible anymore. even if i just hide away, the damage is done. the whole game is rigged. it's like trying to fix a sinking ship with a spoon. i just keep thinking about how much easier it would be if i didn't have to carry all this weight. if i could just stop feeling like this. if there was just a way to finally have some actual peace, instead of this constant, grinding struggle.",
